@startuml
title 9.3 Customer Cancels Order - sequence diagram
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 240
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ParticipantBorderColor #444444
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

actor Customer as U
participant "View" as V <<View>> #EADCFF
participant OrderController as C <<Controller>> #D8F3DC
participant OrderService as S <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant OrderRepository as OR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9
participant PaymentRepository as PR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9
participant OrderDetailRepository as DR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9
participant ProductRepository as PDR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9
participant CouponService as CS <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant RefundRepository as RR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9
participant NotificationService as N <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant OrderMailSender as MAIL <<Service>> #DCECFF

== A. Customer cancels the order ==
U -> V : click "Hủy đơn hàng" (shown for PENDING, AWAITING_DEPOSIT,\nDEPOSIT_PAID, PROCESSING, AWAITING_QUOTE, QUOTED)
V -> V : open the box: optional reason (max 255),\nwarning "Bạn đã thanh toán ..." when something was paid
U -> V : "Xác nhận hủy" (or "Giữ đơn" closes the box)
V -> C : POST /api/orders/{userId}/{orderId}/cancel\n{ "reason": trimmed text }
C -> C : requireOwner(userId, currentUser)
alt userId differs from the logged-in user
  C --> V : 403 Không có quyền truy cập đơn hàng này.
  V --> U : error under the box
else owner
  alt reason longer than 255 characters
    C --> V : 400 Lý do hủy tối đa 255 ký tự.
    V --> U : error under the box
  else reason ok
    C -> S : cancelByCustomer(userId, orderId, reason)
    S -> OR : findByIdForUpdate(orderId) (row lock)
    OR --> S : Order (empty when missing or owned by another customer)
    alt not found or not owned
      S --> C : 404 Không tìm thấy đơn hàng.
      C --> V : 404 {message}
      V --> U : error under the box
    else found
      alt status is DELIVERING, COMPLETED, CANCELLED, REFUNDED (not in the list)
        S --> C : 400 Đơn đã giao cho đơn vị vận chuyển hoặc đã kết thúc, không thể hủy.
        C --> V : 400 {message}
        V --> U : error under the box
      else cancellable status
        S -> PR : findByOrderId(orderId)
        PR --> S : payments
        S -> S : paid = sum of SUCCESS payments
        S -> S : status = CANCELLED, cancelReason = "Khách hủy đơn: <reason>"
        S -> OR : save(order)
        S -> DR : findByOrderId(orderId)
        DR --> S : details
        loop each detail whose product is not CUSTOM
          S -> PDR : findByIdForUpdate(productId)
          S -> PDR : save(stock + quantity)
        end
        S -> CS : release(order)
        note right of CS : skipped when couponsReleased is already true;\nusedCount - 1 for order and shipping coupon
        S -> PR : failPendingByOrderId(orderId, customerId)
        note right of PR : PENDING payments (e.g. unpaid SePay or COD) become FAILED
        alt paid > 0
          S -> RR : save(Refund REQUESTED, amount = paid, reason = cancel text)
          S -> N : notifyRefundRequested(refund)
          N -> N : bell to the shop owner "Yêu cầu hoàn tiền" (/shop-admin/refunds)
        end
        S --> C : void
        C --> V : 204 No Content
        V -> V : reload the order detail, close the box
        V --> U : status "Đã hủy" and, when paid, the refund line "Yêu cầu hoàn tiền"
      end
    end
  end
end

== B. Mail after the commit ==
OR --> MAIL : OrderStatusChangedEvent(previous status -> CANCELLED) after commit
note right of MAIL : "Đơn hàng đã bị hủy" mail, only with a verified email (13.3)

== C. What the customer can still do ==
note over V
  A refund in REQUESTED state can be withdrawn by the customer ("Hủy yêu cầu", 5.4).
  The cart is not refilled after a customer cancel; the SePay invoice of an unpaid online order is not closed here,
  so money paid later on that invoice becomes a new refund request (5.2 late money).
end note

@enduml
